(setter_probe -- two-pass probe onto the fixed tool setter)

(Traverses to the setter and probes it twice, leaving the tool at the trigger)
(point. Position and speeds come from [TOOLSENSOR] in the ini file. Requires a)
(homed machine: the approach is issued in G53.)

o<setter_probe> sub

  M5

  G21 G40 G49 G90 G94

  G53 G0 Z#<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]SAFE_Z>
  G53 G0 X#<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]X> Y#<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]Y>

  G91
  G38.2 Z[0 - #<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]MAXPROBE>] F#<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]SEARCH_VEL>
  G0 Z0.5
  G38.2 Z-1 F#<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]PROBE_VEL>
  G90

o<setter_probe> endsub
